a a sua volta rieducata in un istituto speciale. La piccola è scostante, astiosa, e stabilire un contatto con lei risulta un'impresa disperata, ma la sua educatrice non molla.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Un terremoto emotivo!","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"1962-05-23","status":"Released","rating":7.9,"ratingCount":362,"genres":["Dramma","Storia"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"107m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":10774,"name":"Anne Bancroft","role":"Annie Sullivan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ydabiabIsMBe2HsNmx43gBpqzxx.jpg"},{"id":27446,"name":"Patty Duke","role":"Helen Keller","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kksWwV7ECdJWKc269U2qU6GtBN5.jpg"},{"id":15666,"name":"Victor Jory","role":"Captain Arthur Keller","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6H3Qr1HcKNEp9p3ZNUqs1YQ1aeW.jpg"},{"id":15667,"name":"Inga Swenson","role":"Kate Keller","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c09amkuxllrFkiX8mXwrIdcn0H7.jpg"},{"id":15668,"name":"Andrew Prine","role":"James Keller","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oe0MoG0m2bRap16cG8359azdrUi.jpg"},{"id":15669,"name":"Kathleen Comegys","role":"Aunt Ev","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3eHDGKUn6hR0EVAwZKyuKAb0vtS.jpg"},{"id":101434,"name":"John Bliss","role":"Admissions Officer (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q7vlPDur2IJhZa9gHx2uQQlE5dI.jpg"},{"id":2251962,"name":"Grant Code","role":"Doctor (uncredited)"},{"id":3470075,"name":"Michele Farr","role":"Annie at Age 10 (uncredited)"},{"id":1769134,"name":"Jack Hollander","role":"Mr. Anagnos of Perkins School in Boston (uncredited)"},{"id":1848285,"name":"Alan Howard","role":"Jimmie at Age 8 (uncredited)"},{"id":193808,"name":"Judith Lowry","role":"1st Crone (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9849vWYLDiWLGwshaIkgxPg0M1A.jpg"},{"id":1187867,"name":"William F. Haddock","role":"2nd Crone (uncredited)"},{"id":10561,"name":"Helen Ludlam","role":"3rd Crone (uncredited)"},{"id":32774,"name":"Beah Richards","role":"Viney (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aJmFZrnKpQFVM8kCbPLEosighTh.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Anna dei miracoli","overview":"Helen Keller è una bimba cieca e sordomuta, figlia di benestanti degli Stati del Sud di inizio secolo che la affidano a una educatrice alla prima esperienza. Lei, Anne Sullivan, era stata a sua volta rieducata in un istituto speciale. La piccola è scostante, astiosa, e stabilire un contatto con lei risulta un'impresa disperata, ma la sua educatrice non molla.","tagline":"Un terremoto emotivo!"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"The true story of the frightening, lonely world of silence and darkness of 7-year-old Helen Keller who, since infancy, has never seen the sky, heard her mother's voice or expressed her innermost feelings. Then Annie Sullivan, a 20-year-old teacher from Boston, arrives. Having just recently regained her own sight, the no-nonsense Annie reaches out to Helen through the power of touch, the only tool they have in common, and leads her bold pupil on a miraculous journey from fear and isolation to happiness and light.","tagline":"An emotional earthquake!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mRaMdwwjobUyKiUC7IrtQUV5fXh.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5bvQEihHBKJ0Rs1J46HcG0wASDr.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
